{"full":"hf:huggingface-projects/diffusiongemma-3d-gen","spaceId":"huggingface-projects/diffusiongemma-3d-gen","name":"Gemma Diffusion 3D Asset Builder","source":"huggingface","description":"Diffuse an SVG game asset and watch it extrude into live 3D","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":8,"created":"2026-06-10T15:31:12.000Z","updated":"2026-06-10T15:36:23.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://huggingface-projects-diffusiongemma-3d-gen.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/huggingface-projects/diffusiongemma-3d-gen","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T01:44:33.087Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T01:44:33.087Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T01:44:33.087Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧊","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A live, side-by-side visualization of block-diffusion generation. Describe a game asset (a sword, potion, treasure chest, spaceship, ...) and the model designs an original SVG illustration by denoising a canvas of random tokens — every position updates at once each step. A fixed, hand-written Three.js harness then extrudes that SVG into an interactive, spinning 3D object.","The left pane shows the raw SVG canvas diffusing token-by-token (the signature look of text diffusion); the right pane shows the extruded 3D scene (drag to orbit). Type a follow-up to tweak in place: the previous artwork seeds the diffusion's starting canvas (via the model's native canvasids API), so the model edits the existing asset instead of regenerating from scratch."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/huggingface-projects/diffusiongemma-3d-gen/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"aacffdd782f3f406536e16a289d5860e90ad84c692d9f3747b504192d50a5f91","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T02:31:44.216Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T01:44:33.122Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A li